## Record Owner

Owner (id+name), team, since, provenance (assigned / claimed / round-robin / escalation) and one hop of trail. Meant to have one writer — the consumer's assign action — so reassignment always leaves a trace. The owner is stored as card id plus display name rather than a link, so a list row renders without loading the owner card and the one-hop trail stays readable after that card changes.

```ts
import { RecordOwnerField } from '@cardstack/catalog/fields/record-owner/record-owner-field';

@field owner = contains(RecordOwnerField);
```

### Non-goals

Not an ACL and not a full history — the timeline owns the trail beyond one hop.
